mapping "V4474.1" source="V4474" target="274913009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V4474 is the Swedish national extension of ICD-10 V44.7 (Car occupant injured in
        collision with heavy transport vehicle or bus, person on outside of vehicle injured in traffic
        accident) with an added activity qualifier (vitalaktivitet such as rest/sleep/meal/personal
        hygiene). The activity dimension has no separate SNOMED CT representation. Targets inherit the
        verified Athena SNOMED 274913009 36198007 crosswalk of the parent V44.7: SNOMED CT 433930 (Motor
        vehicle on road in collision with another motor vehicle, 274913009) and 444074 (Victim of
        vehicular AND/OR traffic accident, 36198007). The target fully captures the accident mechanism;
        the dropped activity suffix is orthogonal metadata, so the relationship is broader. high:
        verified crosswalk inherited from parent, small well-understood breadth mismatch (activity
        qualifier dropped).
        """
}
mapping "V4474.2" source="V4474" target="36198007" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
}
