        Source V4478 is the Swedish national extension of ICD-10 V44.7 (Car occupant injured in
        collision with heavy transport vehicle or bus, person on outside of vehicle injured in traffic
        accident) with activity qualifier SNOMED CT 274913009 36198007 (other specified activities). No
        SNOMED CT representation for the activity dimension. Targets inherit the verified Athena crosswalk
        of parent V44.7: SNOMED CT 433930 (274913009) and 444074 (36198007). Accident mechanism fully
        captured by targets; activity suffix dropped, so broader. high: crosswalk inherited from parent
        V44.7, small well-understood breadth mismatch.
        """
}
